(6338452, 938573, 110041, '<td valign="top">Loads of character in this photo, really amusing. Helped by spot on lighting and detail. Colours are great as well, giving and interesting contrast to the subject.</td>', 'Loads of character in this photo, really amusing. Helped by spot on lighting and detail. Colours are great as well, giving and interesting contrast to the subject.', '2011-03-02 03:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338465, 937772, 7369, '<td valign="top">My favourite photo this week. Less is definitely more in this case. It looks simple but it is a very good execution of the challenge. Technically the photo is flawless. The composition is excellent: you have find the right balance between the negative space and your subject. The  contrast between the white space and the glass with the gold fish is amazing. I do hope the fish was ok afterwards ;-). I give you a solid 10.</td>', 'My favourite photo this week. Less is definitely more in this case. It looks simple but it is a very good execution of the challenge. Technically the photo is flawless. The composition is excellent: you have find the right balance between the negative space and your subject. The  contrast between the white space and the glass with the gold fish is amazing. I do hope the fish was ok afterwards ;-). I give you a solid 10.', '2011-03-02 04:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338511, 938053, 96574, '<td valign="top">"ride the king''s highway, baby"<br/> <br/>well, i hope that was the reference anyway<br/> <br/>very nice shot...7</td>', '"ride the king''s highway, baby" well, i hope that was the reference anyway very nice shot...7', '2011-03-02 06:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
