(6338635, 938297, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the concept. The photo is well exposed. I think the lighting is a little bright, giving the photo a cold feel overall and making the skin somewhat pale. Perhaps that was the intent. If it was I am understanding the message to be a search for extra-terrestrial life rather than a search for spiritual life. Although, if I think of the concept of the holiness of God, his holiness burns brighter than any fire so would that light be warm or cold? At least you made me think much! Nice job.</td>', 'Love the concept. The photo is well exposed. I think the lighting is a little bright, giving the photo a cold feel overall and making the skin somewhat pale. Perhaps that was the intent. If it was I am understanding the message to be a search for extra-terrestrial life rather than a search for spiritual life. Although, if I think of the concept of the holiness of God, his holiness burns brighter than any fire so would that light be warm or cold? At least you made me think much! Nice job.', '2011-03-02 08:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
