(6341070, 937847, 113419, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS!  Love the colors of the bottles, wonderful job with the arrangement, great catch of the reflection, loving how you can almost see through them, the fact that they all match (except for the colors) makes me want to look at the longer, they all seem to be perfect - great work!  thanks for sharing  (makes me wanna shoot some bottles!)</td>', 'I LOVE THIS!  Love the colors of the bottles, wonderful job with the arrangement, great catch of the reflection, loving how you can almost see through them, the fact that they all match (except for the colors) makes me want to look at the longer, they all seem to be perfect - great work!  thanks for sharing  (makes me wanna shoot some bottles!)', '2011-03-04 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
