(6342077, 938848, 2615, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! Fantastic lighting and contrast. I think if that projected image was not there it would be even better.</td>', 'What a great shot! Fantastic lighting and contrast. I think if that projected image was not there it would be even better.', '2011-03-05 12:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
