(6342090, 938800, 2615, '<td valign="top">Good, but for me the area around the subject really doesn''t lend much effect. Also, there are a lot of hot pixels on the arm and nose.</td>', 'Good, but for me the area around the subject really doesn''t lend much effect. Also, there are a lot of hot pixels on the arm and nose.', '2011-03-05 13:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
