(6342093, 938854, 2615, '<td valign="top">Nice! I am not normally a car fan but this is very appealing in general. Like the lines and perspective. Not possible in basic editing, I know, but I think removing the logos from the car in the foreground would give more weight to the great lines.</td>', 'Nice! I am not normally a car fan but this is very appealing in general. Like the lines and perspective. Not possible in basic editing, I know, but I think removing the logos from the car in the foreground would give more weight to the great lines.', '2011-03-05 13:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
