(6342099, 938715, 2615, '<td valign="top">Like the color and reflection but I think it would be stronger if the watch were moved to eliminate the shadow on the face. Like most of the dof but would like to see the whole watch face in focus and a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Like the color and reflection but I think it would be stronger if the watch were moved to eliminate the shadow on the face. Like most of the dof but would like to see the whole watch face in focus and a bit more contrast.', '2011-03-05 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
