(6346899, 937505, 8171, '<td valign="top">Thanks all - it''s a picture of a swinging bridge they''re building there and this was taken around 4ish I guess when the UK sun was already dropping low in the sky.<br/> <br/>I take the point about the too tight crop at the top but I didn''t have much room to play with.  Also the point about using mono instead - I did toy with the idea and maybe should have gone that way.<br/> <br/>Anyhow, on another note this was the only shot where the painters lined up in an interesting arrangement - every other shot was juts arms and legs poking out of the poles!</td>', 'Thanks all - it''s a picture of a swinging bridge they''re building there and this was taken around 4ish I guess when the UK sun was already dropping low in the sky. I take the point about the too tight crop at the top but I didn''t have much room to play with.  Also the point about using mono instead - I did toy with the idea and maybe should have gone that way. Anyhow, on another note this was the only shot where the painters lined up in an interesting arrangement - every other shot was juts arms and legs poking out of the poles!', '2011-03-09 12:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
