(6364612, 938830, 76335, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, late in the afternoon, the sun sends gorgeous beams of light through our windows, and everything in their path is cast into a beautifully golden still life. But just for a few precious moments. If I''m lucky, I can get to my camera in time. I wonder if something like that happened here.</td>', 'Sometimes, late in the afternoon, the sun sends gorgeous beams of light through our windows, and everything in their path is cast into a beautifully golden still life. But just for a few precious moments. If I''m lucky, I can get to my camera in time. I wonder if something like that happened here.', '2011-03-27 21:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6371427, 938819, 100831, '<td valign="top">big smile!!</td>', 'big smile!!', '2011-04-03 11:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
